{"id":30138,"slug":"totally-f-ed-up","title":"Totally F***ed Up","year":1993,"country":"United States","duration":79,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/30138-totally-f-ed-up","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/325bd97b351362a1173b47cab32fa2f1/PkbEfmXdavyyvI1gEgVF9Gqqs8dVrc_large.jpg","description":"A delirious mix of punk nihilism and deadpan irony, the first film in Gregg Araki’s Teen Apocalypse Trilogy puts an audaciously queer spin on Jean-Luc Godard’s classic Masculin féminin. Across fifteen jagged episodes, Totally F***ed Up plunges headlong into the lives of a group of queer, disaffected Los Angeles teenagers who form a kind of makeshift family as they navigate desire and heartbreak, societal and familial rejection, and the alienation of growing up gay in an era of relentless moralizing. Both a defiantly raw anthem of outsiderhood and a furious reckoning with all-American homophobia, Araki’s answer to the 1980s teen comedy captures youthful angst with an immediacy that still bruises.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"}],"cast":[{"actor":"James Duval","role":"Andy","slug":"james-duval"},{"actor":"Roko Belic","role":"Tommy","slug":"roko-belic"},{"actor":"Susan Behshid","role":"Michele","slug":"susan-behshid"},{"actor":"Jenee Gill","role":"Patricia","slug":"jenee-gill"},{"actor":"Gilbert Luna","role":"Steven","slug":"gilbert-luna"},{"actor":"Lance May","role":"Deric","slug":"lance-may"},{"actor":"Alan Boyce","role":"Ian","slug":"alan-boyce"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"},{"role":"Shot by","person":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"},{"role":"Edited by","person":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Andrea Sperling","slug":null},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Gregg Araki","slug":"gregg-araki"},{"role":"Associate producer","person":"Alber